────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
SUMMARY
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
The web page `web/src/features/admin/pages/TeslaOrdersPage.tsx` is a thin
`PageContainer` wrapper (title + subtitle) around the shared
`<ActiveOrdersSection/>` surface. The native `ActiveOrdersSection` already ships
(prompt 0196, TeslaSync/feature-views/ActiveOrdersSection.*). This P7 page
reproduces the wrapper HIG-natively: a PageContainer-equivalent scaffold
(on-page title + subtitle header + `.navigationTitle`, web `usePageTitle`)
hosting that section, bound through an `@Observable TeslaOrdersPageModel`
(P1/S8 seam) and routed via value-based navigation (web /tesla-orders).

No placeholders (ADR-011). No networking in the view. All copy from the
platform string catalog (ADR-014). Adaptive macOS + iOS/iPadOS (ADR-002/006).

